<title>USA: Universal Foods president to add CEO title.</title>
<headline>Universal Foods president to add CEO title.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Foods Corp said on Thursday that president Kenneth Manning will succeed Guy Osborn as chief executive officer, effective October 1.</p>
<p>It said Osborn will continue as chairman.</p>
<p>&quot;As part of our planned executive succession, I felt it was time to let Ken Manning further capitalize on the base we have created to leverage Universal Foods' technical competency throughout the food industry and into new markets,&quot; said Osborn in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
